    },
    {
      "heading": "Narrative and fact",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "Many places come with stories: \"energy\", \"vortexes\", \"ancient cities under the mountain\".",
          "origin": "extract"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "Whose land it is",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "Many retreat places have Indigenous peoples and local residents for whom the place is sacred or simply home.",
